kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.0.9 - New Encounter Log, Tutorial Intro, slight balance tweaks","summary":"Demo v0.1.0.9 - New Encounter Log, tweaked Corruption to be slightly lower, adjusted texts.Quality of LifeEncounter Log: tracks what happened during the encounter. You can open and close it on the bottom-right side (little book icon above end turn button).Text Size: Made texts slightly bigger to improve readability on smaller screens (Steamdeck for example). Will probably keep making adjustments as long as we can make it work on screen.Tutorial: Added a small tutorial at the very beginning expla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:45:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041321","verified_at":"2026-10-25T09:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1847286114026926","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.0.8 - Infection Nerf + Description/Tooltips Polish + Plant Artwork","summary":"TL;DR - Infection is making runs a little too hard due to how much Corruption enemies have now, so it got slightly nerfed. Polished some tooltips, and also I'm a sleep-deprived dummy and never got to add the art for the new trees so they are in the game too, so now they are in aswell.BalancePlant Status:- \\ Infection: Corruption generation amount reduced from 5%(min. 1) to 3% (min. 1).The Infection description has been rewritten to clarify that the Corruption generated is based of the max corrup","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:45:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114026926","verified_at":"2026-10-21T05:39:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1846651706691221","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.0.7 - We're in Next Fest!","summary":"TL;DR - It's NextFest and we've updated the demo to play with a considerably different character (Tano) as well as made some drastic corruption balancing to make the game more challenging at late levels. Blessing is less strong now, and Flow has also been nerfed a bit. Also, there's a couple new trees you can play with! (and bug fixes, there's always bugs to fix). Enjoy!ContentNew Plant Cards:Common:Lemon Tree - Water 2 - Essence 1 - TreeWhen watered: Summon a Lemon Branch on a random plotWhen h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:50:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691221","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1844115010505012","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.0.6 - Bugfixes and balance updates","summary":"TL;DR - Found some stuff we needed to fix and balanced out some things here and there.ArtVFX indicator for InfectionVFX indicator for Evil EyeQuality of LifeRun history UI has been adjusted so it shows up to 5 runs per page, to decrease loading times. Game will only save the detailed history of the last 300 runs.Updated how numbers are represented throughout the game so they are formatted similarly across the game, as well as formatted big numbers so they fit the UI.BalanceRun:Corruption needed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T17:29:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505012","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1843481262702827","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.0.4 - New relics, new action cards, balance changes.","summary":"Edit (15/09/2026)We rolled out an additional version but I didn't want to do a separate post for it because they are very close to each other, so I'm just dumping the additional changes below where they fit :)============TL;DR - We have added 21 new relics, as well as 10 new action cards. We are also adjusting the cadence of certain types of rewards, and now that there's more Legendary shiny toys to play with, they'll appear a little more often and will be able to be bought from the shop. Also, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:47:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702827","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1842846814447324","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update (v0.1.0.3) - Reworked enemies + bugfixes","summary":"TL;DR - Fixed some bugs, new card to reposition plants, new status effects, Static Charge has been reworked, and we adjusted some enemies and reworked Tyrannic Grasp. Also, all the stages require a harder score to beat now.Hello everyone! This week we keep updating the demo with balance changes, polish and bug fixes. We also have reworked Tyrannic Grasp.ContentThere are not many ways to reposition in the game, and the Soilshifter is an annoying little bug, so we are adjusting its moveset so play","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T17:13:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447324","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1842212951309506","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Release & Post Release Update! (v0.1.0.2)","summary":"TL;DR - Demo is out, we received feedback and looked through it. Frog boss is getting nerfed substantially while we rework it, all other bosses also getting nerfed/adjusted, Unnatural Disaster and other hard encounters getting nerfed. ON the other hand, overall Corruption required per stage will ramp up.Hello everyone!The demo for THORNSPELL has been released, and we are really excited and hyped for all of the feedback received!As always, when releasing something into the wild, there's positive ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T08:27:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1833334318577794","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"announcement","title":"Our first Playtest is now open! + GES 2026","summary":"Hello everyone!You can now try THORNSPELL in our first playtest and share your feedback with us. It will run at least until June 30th, and we will use your feedback to polish the UI/UX of the game and make sure the experience is designed with fun as a priority.On top of that, we are also part of Game Effect Showcase 2026 alongside with a ton of other awesome games.Soon, more news, there's more exciting stuff cooking behind the scenes.Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-25T18:12:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318577794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4514920-1831432155577968","game_id":"steam-4514920","kind":"announcement","title":"THORNSPELL is part of the Deckbuilders Fest!","summary":"Hello everyone!I'm happy to share that we are part of the Deckbuilders Fest that starts today.I wish I had posted an announcement sooner, but I have been so busy pushing the game forward that I honestly forgot. Whoops.I'll be setting up a broadcast, and try to have one or two every day at various times of the day, so you can check out the game, ask questions, and hang out? (I have never ever set up a broadcast, it's my first time, all of this is my first, expect me to mess up a lot of things!)If","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T16:29:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577968","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4514920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4514920":"2026-10-26T02:51:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4514920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4687950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4514920","app_id":4514920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:39Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"28c9020b556b7b6b5aa8972330e4ad049bef3d860d86dbd04ebbc51ba2b5768a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Embody a magical florist by placing plants strategically in your garden, and watering them to score points. THORNSPELL is a garden-building roguelike where you will create and unleash chains of magical effects, dispelling the corruption spreading through your home.","publishers":[{"name":"MODACH GAMES","creator_clan_account_id":4616288